error[R0303]: `Shop.buy` is a method — call it with `:`
--> 10:9: called with `.` here, so the first argument lands in `self`
    6:1: declared with `:` here
  = note: a `:` declaration takes an implicit self; dot-calling it shifts every argument left by one
  = help: call it as `Shop:buy(...)`
